All findings verified and recorded. Summary of the review:

- **panic-unwrap** — 3 blocking panics on attacker/ caller-controlled input (`handlers.rs:27`, `handlers.rs:36`, `svc-store/src/lib.rs:68`, which additionally indexes `items[0]` without a length check), plus one lower-severity pattern issue in `models.rs:29`.
